# Clube Marketplace Conventions

- `AGENTS.md` is the single source of truth across all projects.
- Harness config files (`CLAUDE.md`, `GEMINI.md`, `.cursorrules`) should contain `@AGENTS.md` to import the canonical instructions.
- All AI skills, agents, commands, and documentation in this repository must remain in English.
- Use 4-phase output for command reporting: Plan → Execution → Summary → Recommended Actions.
